WEBVTT

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.840
Here I go!

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.150
Um...

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.330
Line up!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:32.970
Now... Advance!

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.950
That's right! One, two,

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.600
one, two, one, two!

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.810
Hey, you! Don't hit the one in front of you.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:45.810
Don't go that way!

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.790
Line up!

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.000
Yes, that's right...

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.550
Like that.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.220
Splendid, Hazuki-san!

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
<b>Episode 3:
:The Hexennacht Is Here!</b>

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.040
We both call each other by our first names,

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.010
and we ate french fries at a fast food place.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:46.310
Most of my dreams have 
come true over the past few days.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.480
And I feel a lot closer to 
Tsuchimikado-san... I mean, Shizuka-chan.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:57.030
It's only a matter of time 
before we're friends!

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.990
No, maybe we already are!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.820
No, no, no!

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:05.770
It's too early to decide that, 
Kagimura Hazuki!

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:12.790
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.540
You're weird.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.970
You can do all that, 
but you can't use Buchhülle?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.170
Buchhülle!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.600
I'm sorry. I'm just clumsy.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.770
You definitely have magical talent!

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:40.570
Bouf Hyure is a basic spell. 
You'll pick it up soon.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.780
We need you to.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.910
You can't participate 
in the Hexennacht without it.

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.120
Hexennacht?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:58.430
It's probably time to tell you all about it.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:06.110
Every year, schools from different parts
 of the world battle in the Hexennacht.

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:11.930
The winners are given a type 
of magic that grants any wish.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.560
But most of my wishes have come true...

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:17.670
Sorry?

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.140
N-Never mind! Never mind!

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:21.530
Keep going, Shizuka-chan.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:25.580
This year, the match will be held 
at the Witchcraft School in Japan.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.840
Take their flag. Take over their base...

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.810
Each match has different rules,

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:37.630
but for safety reasons, anybody whose 
 Buchhülle is destroyed has to leave the battle.

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.630
That one rule doesn't change.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.450
Um...

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:54.450
I think the fastest way for you 
to gain a deeper understanding

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:58.360
of the Hexennacht is to see 
what's beyond this door.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:13.840
Huh?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.130
Why?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.460
What's going on?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.340
Let me read you!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:23.340
Only the one chosen by that book can open it.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.840
Then these are all...

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.930
Yes, they're all Origins.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.720
This is the Origin Library.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:39.010
All Witchcraft Schools have 
an Origin Library on their grounds.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:46.490
The Origin Libraries are intimately 
connected to the Hexennacht.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.600
The reasonー

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.010
You guys!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.330
I'm cleaning like I was told!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.250
Tell the principal that!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.120
We didn't come to see 
if you were slacking off.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.250
Huh?

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:03.710
I wanted to explain to her 
what "cleaning" means.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:09.760
Look.

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.610
I-Is this...

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:15.620
They're called Stains.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:20.520
Stains appear where there are 
lots of Origins, and then they eat them.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.270
They eat Origins?

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:27.490
When an Origin is eaten, 
that story is lost.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:35.600
Stains that gain the power of an Origin's 
story become black beasts called Flecks.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:40.320
They become terrifying monsters 
that eat people, Origin Masters, everything.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:43.090
Black beasts... 
Magical beasts called "Flecks"!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:48.280
I-I guess since this is 
a modern magical girl thing,

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:50.300
we do have to have battles?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.010
Is this one of the serious types?

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.050
And with a little bit of gore?

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.430
Calm down, idiot.

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:59.930
It takes years for a Stain to become a Fleck.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:01.970
And even if one does appear,

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:06.800
the really powerful Origin Masters who 
graduated from the school will take care of it.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.800
Our Maedchen's job is to...

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:17.930
Clean.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:19.120
That's right.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:22.940
Stains are also called black magic.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:28.190
They're the exact opposite 
of our white magic.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.780
White neutralizes black.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:37.270
Using lots of magic 
keeps Stains from forming.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:43.110
The Hexennacht requires all 
the power the Maedchens have.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:47.950
It's also a big cleaning that seals away 
all the Stains in the academy.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:53.780
In other words, participating in the 
Hexennacht means protecting the world!

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.430
Protecting the world...

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.250
Yes. I'm very proud of that...

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:04.090
Of being able to fight in the 
same Hexennacht my mother did.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.210
Let's protect the world together, 
Shizuka-chan! Let's do it!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.720
Isn't it too soon to say that, 
since you can't even use a Buchhülle?

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:13.670
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.830
At least we can finally get started.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.900
Only seven schools out of all

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:22.170
the schools in the world 
can go to the Hexennacht.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:27.400
Japan's school and we, the Coalition school, 
 are vying for the last spot.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.660
But since there weren't 
enough Japanese players,

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.860
we were never able to get started!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:38.480
The last spot will be taken by Japan.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:43.080
After seeing the way 
you act up close, I'm sure of it.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:46.500
The Coalition is nothing to fear.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.380
Listen to you.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.880
The principal won't come to stop us here.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:59.600
And it's a great way 
to get rid of all the Stains, too.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.020
Come, Shuten-Doji!

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.480
Let your power dwell 
within me, Moon Princess!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:14.840
No!

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.830
If you fight here, the books will...

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.450
Shut up!

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.450
You can't destroy an Origin that easily.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.230
Wh-What do I do?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:30.820
What?

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:31.790
Stain.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.080
N-No!

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.020
S-Somebody get it off!

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.680
Idiot, stop it!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.420
No! No! No!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.490
Stop waving it around!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.270
You won't get it off that way!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.870
U-Um...

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.830
Is something wrong, Hazuki-san?

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.480
Um... I'm sorry.

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:10.080
You don't need to apologize 
so many times. It's fine.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:11.540
But...

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.670
Now we're even.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:19.570
So I won't let you apologize any more.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.590
Yeah.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:21.960
I'm back.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:23.620
Welcome back.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.270
Hazuki-san.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.340
You're late, huh?

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.220
Um, well...

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:30.320
I was training.

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:31.060
Training?

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.290
Did you join a club?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:39.880
Y-Yeah.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.700
I haven't officially joined, though.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:43.230
I see.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.110
Next time you'll be late, call me first.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:47.400
O-Okay!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.170
Good luck with your club.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:52.260
Yeah...

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:53.130
I'll do my best.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.940
And come down soon. 
Dinner will be ready.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.340
Okay!

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.260
A club?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.390
Good luck with your club.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:14.420
<i>I should tell Saeko-san about Kuzunoha 
Girls' School of Witchcraft, shouldn't I?</i>

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.840
<i>I'm a Maedchen, chosen by an Origin,</i>

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.120
<i>and I'm going to a school of witchcraft.</i>

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:22.770
No way. She'd never believe me!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.790
You were lying about 
being in a club, weren't you?

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:33.060
I've known for a while 
that you're leaving school

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.890
as soon as the last bell rings.

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:40.080
Come on. Answer me.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.240
Um... There's someone I like!

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.060
They go to another school, 
and they're really nice!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:07.030
They really care about me...

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.280
So... so...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.090
Got it.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.220
That's fine.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:15.010
Um, but...

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:18.000
So? What is he like?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.240
Is he cool?

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.840
Cool... They're more like pretty.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.260
Very elegant.

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:26.510
And they live in a very expensive house.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:29.250
I see.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.610
One of those, huh?

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:33.060
If it goes well, you're set for life!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.400
Set for life?

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.730
You're going all the way 
to another school to see him?

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:42.810
You've got more guts than I thought.

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:45.960
You should've told me sooner.

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:49.160
U-Um, I think you're misunderstanding...

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.360
To be honest,

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.870
I thought having a little sister 
would be really annoying.

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:57.350
And you're weird the way you only read books.

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.080
I was sure we'd never get along.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.190
Well, Mom's free to get 
remarried if she wants,

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.990
so I was willing to just play along.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.260
But if that's the situation, 
I'm willing to help.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.180
Do your best, okay?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.480
I'll come up with a story to tell Mom.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.440
U-Um...

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.020
Good luck!

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.390
Words have power.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:33.480
A story is a world created by words,

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.080
and Origins are those worlds given form,

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.100
and thus the ultimate magic.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:41.130
We've researched the Origins 
from an academic perspective for years,

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.550
but we still know very little.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:49.010
But stories are meaningless 
if they just sit there.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:52.320
They need readers, observers.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:57.570
The Origins choose sensitive,
 imaginative teenage girls

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.650
Excuse me.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.230
That is you, the Maedchen.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:04.020
If it isn't the head of 
the Tsuchimikado clan.

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.590
We've been waiting for you.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.320
Shizuka-kun.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:10.170
This is the judge of this year's Hexennacht,

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:13.340
sent by the Committee of 13.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.120
It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.010
I am Tsuchimikado Shizuka.

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:19.830
The date for the match has been decided.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.100
One month from now, on December 25th,

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.500
the Japanese and Coalition schools will fight,

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:28.460
and the winner will earn 
the right to participate

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.800
in the Hexennacht that begins January 1st.

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:33.810
By the way,

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.080
I heard your third combatant 
is from the other side?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.500
Be careful.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.320
They don't understand 
the value of the Origins.

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:48.210
We need you to teach her 
that she's only a part of the Origin.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.280
Judge...

00:14:51.310 --> 00:14:51.950
Well?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.220
Why not just rewrite her memories?

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:58.430
Is that the opinion of the Committee?

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.110
Or your personal opinion?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.080
My personal opinion.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.750
For now.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:14.770
Damned Origin Fundamentalists..

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:19.880
Was that your first direct experience 
with the Committee of 13?

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:20.730
Yes.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.200
Don't worry.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:23.940
I won't let them do what they want.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.900
I'll protect the students of the school.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:31.090
It's no good.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:33.740
Ariko-san, do you have any advice?

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:41.720
<i>I hope Shizuka-chan comes soon...</i>

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.440
Are those girls famous?

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.620
I guess.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.950
They're the leaders of the schools 
participating in the Hexennacht.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.530
Li Xuemei from the Chinese school.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:11.250
Maria Rasputin from the Russian school.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:13.280
Mahakali from India.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.450
They're all equally powerful Origin Users.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.750
Find out more online.

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:30.260
The leaders of the various schools 
are like idols to Maedchen.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.430
There are more than 
one or two unofficial fan sites.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:35.840
What?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.550
There's a page for Shizuka-chan!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:41.400
Sure there is. She's the leader 
of the Japanese school.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.100
It's even got her measurements!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.170
Where do they get this personal information?

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.420
Her birthday is in December.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.430
I need to hurry and get ready!

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.940
If the leaders are here,

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.230
that means the date of the 
preliminary match has been decided.

00:16:57.230 --> 00:17:00.850
They came early to learn 
what they can from us.

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.000
I'm a little curious...

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.420
The top three aren't here.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.150
Tsuchimikado Shizuka.

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.700
Agathe, Arthur...

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.720
Hello.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:22.600
The famous British and German schools...

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.940
It's an honor to be the 
first to be greeted by them.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.890
Welcome to the Japanese school.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.410
We're glad to have you.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.820
No need for greetings.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.340
More importantly, I heard you 
found the Cinderella Origin?

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:38.660
It originally belonged to the German school.

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.280
We ask that it be returned immediately.

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:44.290
But there's already a contractor...

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.510
Can she fight?

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:47.640
The girl chosen by Cinderella.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:48.750
What do you mean?

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.310
It's not known for sure if Hazuki-san... 
the Cinderella Maedchen...

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.590
will go to the Hexennacht.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.030
That's strange.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.760
The Committee told me that 
the date had been decided.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:03.390
No.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:07.130
The Japanese school has to participate.

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.930
All three of us have to be there.

00:18:08.930 --> 00:18:10.150
That's right.

00:18:10.150 --> 00:18:12.690
We're supposed to be the top three, 
so if you don't participate,

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.900
it will bring shame to the 
Moon Princess, the oldest Origin.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:18.360
And your mother would be sad, too.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:23.080
Your country lost many Origin Masters 
in that disaster seven years ago.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:27.990
I'm told your mother perished, as well.

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:30.360
It was a terrible loss.

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:35.340
Even the German school knew the name 
of the Moon Princess and its Origin Master.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:39.600
And you, her daughter, 
have inherited the Moon Princess.

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.010
That power must be offered at the Hexennacht.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.470
I expect that is what your mother would want.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.300
Th-That's...

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:50.620
There they are.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.280
And anyway,

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.850
why is a Maedchen powerful enough 
to be chosen by Cinderella

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:02.380
still not certain if she's 
going to the Hexennacht?

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.020
I can't understand it.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.560
She hasn't learned to use Buchhülle yet...

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.750
Buchhülle?

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.880
She hasn't even learned 
that most basic of spells yet?

00:19:11.890 --> 00:19:14.460
Some people are better 
at certain things than others...

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.930
Then find another combatant.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:19.410
I'm under no obligation to help an enemy,

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:21.430
but it's ridiculous for the Japanese school

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.460
to miss the Hexennacht because 
of one useless Maedchen.

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.960
Th-That's not what's going on.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:27.690
It's not Hazuki-san's fault...

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.930
U-Um...

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:31.940
Hey!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:34.900
Hazuki-san!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.970
I-I'm Kagimura Hazuki!

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.540
A student at the Japanese school!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:50.080
<i>Most of my dreams came true 
over the past few days.</i>

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.330
<i>It's all thanks to Shizuka-chan.</i>

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:56.470
<i>Cinderella, please, lend me your power!</i>

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:59.310
Buchhülle!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:04.600
Disintegration and reconstruction 
are beginning...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.180
<i>It's flowing into me...</i>

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.620
<i>It's surging towards me...</i>

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:13.770
<i>It's trying to swallow me!</i>

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:17.440
Hazuki-san!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.570
It's impossible!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:23.660
I can't handle this all on my own!

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.290
No! Don't reject it!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:33.770
Snow...

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.540
No.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.640
The ashes of the cinder princess...

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:48.430
You really do like taking your clothes off.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.600
It wasn't deliberate!

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.810
Pump... Pumpkin!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.510
Shizuka-chan...

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:07.920
I'll do my best.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:10.790
I'll master the Buchhülle before the match...

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.420
Thank you.

00:23:05.850 --> 00:23:07.150
I'm Yumilia Qazan.

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:08.470
I'm Hazuki.

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:10.020
Sorry, can I go home?

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:11.850
No, we just started!

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:13.480
And why are you standing so far away?

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:14.280
Come over here.

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:16.350
I'm sorry. I don't have my wallet today.

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:18.060
I'm not trying to steal your lunch money!

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:20.720
And why are you only scared when I'm around?

00:23:20.720 --> 00:23:21.400
Oh, time's up.

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.810
Next time, "A place to be, 
a place to call home".

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Episode 4:
A Place to Be, a Place to Call Home</b>

00:23:23.810 --> 00:23:25.930
Thanks. Bye now.

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:27.350
I'm gonna cry. Damn it!

00:23:27.350 --> 00:23:28.460
Bye.

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:29.050
Wait!

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:29.470
Bye.

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:30.360
Wait!

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:31.070
Bye.

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:32.100
Wait! Please!

00:23:32.100 --> 00:23:33.590
Bye!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.310
<b>Illustration: Mozukuzu</b>
